{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey into the forgotten world of <strong>Helix: Descent N Ascent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/b6b84bd77a911459bc2b1193ae4c3aa2.webp?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a dull, dark, disembodied world. Though you're usually alone, you soon encounter another being who looks just like you, except he always seems to be at odds with you. Who is this doppelganger? Is he a friend or a foe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/787bbab0c2bf23d37e6aa2f95c272438.poster.avif?t=1772828385\" width=622 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/787bbab0c2bf23d37e6aa2f95c272438.webm?t=1772828385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/9531a7d43d80f2bb66f271b10f96d981.webp?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new powers as you progress through your adventure. Each one of these powers allows you to meaningfully interact with your surroundings and solve the many puzzles awaiting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/533b8b2d9bbbc45e40d1e1fd7551b033.poster.avif?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/533b8b2d9bbbc45e40d1e1fd7551b033.webm?t=1772828385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/0c974d6603ecd3a5c308231129ef8bc7.webp?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique mix-and-match system that allows you to combine these powers. Play in 25 distinctive ways, jumping between 3 levels of complexity while you explore the barren lands of Helix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/d0de91999601005687740778c8aa6dd5.poster.avif?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/d0de91999601005687740778c8aa6dd5.webm?t=1772828385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/1d67c914b9a7c0bebceedde55672b838.webp?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond adventure, Helix invites you to reflect on identity, solitude and relationships. It weaves each mystery and reminiscence of a past existence with personal, cultural, and spiritual threads. Uncover overlooked details in a story worth revisiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/623967e0cfbbc45dc4fb8a241a8629c7.poster.avif?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/623967e0cfbbc45dc4fb8a241a8629c7.webm?t=1772828385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/extras/7d91a898dbd643fca3d7725e4bd9808b.webp?t=1772828385\" width=620 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tale not told with words, but through an immersive adventure enriched by stunning 4K black-and-white artwork, living 2D scenery, evocative paintings, and powerful atmospheric music. Drawing inspiration from 1980s black-and-white indie comics, 1990s manga, and 1970s Franco-Belgian comics, the monochrome imagery is symbolic, evoking the dichotomy of light and darkness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2736370?t=1772828385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2736370?t=1772828385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/9c8b58e628124bfaa122d51efdc8f0a3cf68ce0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772828385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736370/9c8b58e628124bfaa122d51efdc8f0a3cf68ce0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772828385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4371160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey into the forgotten world of <strong>Helix: Descent N Ascent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_par